  "chain": "failure to use HU tools + inadequate procedure guidance [cause A] -> temporary PSW modification incorrectly installed on Bravo MCRAC -> Bravo MCRAC subsystem inoperable (29 days) [concurrent with independent Alpha MCRAC low-refrigerant inoperability] -> twelve TS-prohibited conditions experienced (MODE 3 completion times exceeded; fuel moves continued in conflict with TS)",
